    <string name="guide_title">How to use it</string>
    <string name="guide_body">1. On this page, turn on the floating panel.\n2. Tap the cat paw on screen to open the panel, then draw the taps and swipes you want.\n3. Switch the panel to \"Run\" and press Run.\n\nYou can also open \"Rules\" and turn a hand gesture or a spoken word into a trigger.</string>
